flowchart LR
    A[Push a main/master\ncon cambios en app-javaee] --> B[Checkout]
    B --> C[Setup JDK 8 + Maven cache]
    C --> D[mvn clean package -DskipTests]
    D --> E[SCP: banca-nacional.ear → /tmp/]
    E --> F[SSH: mv a deployments/\nremove markers]
    F --> G{Verificar .ear.deployed}
    G -- Sí --> H[SUCCESS]
    G -- .ear.failed --> I[FAILED]
    G -- Timeout 60s --> J[TIMEOUT]
